</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>adresse_hal</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Adresse 7 bits decalee (0xC0, 0xC2, 0xC4). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>voie</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Voie 0-7 ; toute autre valeur est refusee. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>valeur</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Code 12 bits (0-4095). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="retval"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>HAL_StatusTypeDef</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>de la transmission (HAL_ERROR si voie &gt; 7). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Exemple d&apos;utilisation</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">EcrireDACEeprom(&amp;hi2c1,<sp/>0xC0,<sp/>5,<sp/>1056);<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>seuil<sp/>2PSp<sp/>garde<sp/>a<sp/>la<sp/>coupure</highlight></codeline>
