<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Aucun.</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Ligne USART1 a chaque ecriture : &quot;DAC_NV:2PSp:V=860:I=1056:OK&quot; (ou &quot;:ERREUR_n&quot;). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Exemple d&apos;utilisation</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">DAC_TraiterSauvegardes();<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>dans<sp/>la<sp/>boucle<sp/>for(;;)<sp/>de<sp/>StartLwipTask()</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
